>a </span><span begin="00:31.747" end="00:32.279">thought</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.623" end="00:36.440"><span begin="00:32.623" end="00:33.289">You'll </span><span begin="00:33.289" end="00:33.627">be </span><span begin="00:33.627" end="00:34.847">mine </span><span begin="00:34.847" end="00:35.103">would </span><span begin="00:35.103" end="00:35.391">you </span><span begin="00:35.391" end="00:36.440">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.696" end="00:39.772"><span begin="00:36.696" end="00:36.986">If </span><span begin="00:36.986" end="00:37.296">I </span><span begin="00:37.296" end="00:37.879">took </span><span begin="00:37.879" end="00:38.207">your </span><span begin="00:38.207" end="00:38.845">hand </span><span begin="00:38.845" end="00:39.772">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.325" end="00:46.155"><span begin="00:40.325" end="00:40.629">Know </span><span begin="00:40.629" end="00:40.993">you're </span><span begin="00:40.993" end="00:42.229">all </span><span begin="00:42.229" end="00:42.525">that </span><span begin="00:42.525" end="00:42.870">I </span><span begin="00:42.870" end="00:44.449">want </span><span begin="00:44.449" end="00:44.763">is </span><span begin="00:44.763" end="00:46.155">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.461" end="00:50.819"><span begin="00:48.461" end="00:48.782">I'll </span><span begin="00:48.782" end="00:49.336">imagine </span><span begin="00:49.336" end="00:49.622">we </span><span begin="00:49.622" end="00:49.848">fell </span><span begin="00:49.848" end="00:50.197">in </span><span begin="00:50.197" end="00:50.819">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.085" end="00:54.523"><span begin="00:51.085" end="00:51.254">I'll </span><span begin="00:51.254" end="00:51.555">nap </span><span begin="00:51.555" end="00:52.027">under </span><span begin="00:52.027" end="00:52.931">moonlight </span><span begin="00:52.931" end="00:53.602">skies </span><span begin="00:53.602" end="00:53.946">with </sp