13.873" end="01:14.209">with </span><span begin="01:14.209" end="01:15.307">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.274" end="01:52.202"><span begin="01:47.274" end="01:47.490">My </span><span begin="01:47.490" end="01:48.066">love </span><span begin="01:48.066" end="01:48.370">will </span><span begin="01:48.370" end="01:49.249">always </span><span begin="01:49.249" end="01:50.218">stay </span><span begin="01:50.218" end="01:50.954">by </span><span begin="01:50.954" end="01:52.202">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.250" end="01:58.058"><span begin="01:53.250" end="01:53.922">I'll </span><span begin="01:53.922" end="01:54.551">keep </span><span begin="01:54.551" end="01:54.813">it </span><span begin="01:54.813" end="01:55.417">safe </span><span begin="01:55.417" end="01:55.754">so </span><span begin="01:55.754" end="01:56.309">don't </span><span begin="01:56.309" end="01:56.642">you </span><span begin="01:56.642" end="01:57.242">worry </span><span begin="01:57.242" end="01:57.538">a </span><span begin="01:57.538" end="01:58.058">thing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.266" end="02:01.413"><span begin="01:58.266" end="01:58.546">I'll </span><span begin="01:58.546" end="01:58.849">tell </span><span begin="01:58.849" end="01:59.100">you </span><span begin="01:59.100" end="01:59.417">I </span><span begin="01:59.417" end="02:00.053">love </span><span begin="02:00.053" end="02:00.381">you </span><span begin="02:00.381" end="02:01.413">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.870" end="02:05.306"><span begin="02:01.870" end="02:02.221">It's </span><span begin="02:02.221" end="02:02.805">stuck </span><span begin="02:02.805" end="02:03.093">with </span><span begin="02:03.093" end="02:03.780">you </span><span begin="02:03.780" end="02:05.306">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.561" end="02:08.473"><span begin="02:05.561" end="02:05.842">So </span><span begin="02:05.842" end="02:06.488">promise </span><span begin="02:06.488" end="02:06.8